  data: {
    LLM: "1. Players reveal cards to claim Flip/Flop pots immediately.\n2. Standard Draw/Discard Rummy play ensues.\n3. Melds: Sets (3+ of a kind) or Runs (3+ sequential in suit).\n4. Dropping: At the start of your turn, you can place your cards face-up to 'Drop' (Knock). If you have the lowest point total, you win the Game Pot. If someone has lower/equal, you lose double ('Caught').",
    Player: "1. Players reveal cards to claim Flip/Flop pots immediately.\n2. Standard Draw/Discard Rummy play ensues.\n3. Melds: Sets (3+ of a kind) or Runs (3+ sequential in suit).\n4. Dropping: At the start of your turn, you can place your cards face-up to 'Drop' (Knock). If you have the lowest point total, you win the Game Pot. If someone has lower/equal, you lose double ('Caught').",
    objective: "Win the 'Game' pot by having the lowest points or going out, and win the 'Flip/Flop' pots by holding low cards.",
    gameplay: "1. Players reveal cards to claim Flip/Flop pots immediately.\n2. Standard Draw/Discard Rummy play ensues.\n3. Melds: Sets (3+ of a kind) or Runs (3+ sequential in suit).\n4. Dropping: At the start of your turn, you can place your cards face-up to 'Drop' (Knock). If you have the lowest point total, you win the Game Pot. If someone has lower/equal, you lose double ('Caught').",
    keyRules: [
      'No Jokers.',
      'Aces are always low (1).',
      "Pay to Play: You can't win a pot you didn't contribute to.",
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
