    turnFlow: "1. Players reveal cards to claim Flip/Flop pots immediately.\n2. Standard Draw/Discard Rummy play ensues.\n3. Melds: Sets (3+ of a kind) or Runs (3+ sequential in suit).\n4. Dropping: At the start of your turn, you can place your cards face-up to 'Drop' (Knock). If you have the lowest point total, you win the Game Pot. If someone has lower/equal, you lose double ('Caught').",
